.TH FL-WEB 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-web \- web browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-web\fR [\fIURL\fR|\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A web browser built with FLTK and \fBWPE WebKit\fR. Each URL or file given opens in a tab; text
that is not an address is searched for.
.PP
The address bar takes addresses, file paths and searches, and completes what you type from
your bookmarks and history. Pages opened by a page (and links clicked with the middle button
or Ctrl) open in new tabs. Downloads go to the Downloads folder; a notification says when one
has finished. Pages that ask for a password, a file, your location or to show notifications ask
you first.
.PP
fl-web draws pages with the CPU: WebKit renders into shared memory and fl-web copies the
picture into its window.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\fBCtrl+L\fR, \fBF6\fR, \fBAlt+D\fR
Edit the address.
.TP
\fBCtrl+T\fR, \fBCtrl+W\fR, \fBCtrl+N\fR
New tab, close the tab, new window.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Tab\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+Tab\fR, \fBCtrl+1\fR..\fBCtrl+9\fR
Next, previous, n-th tab (9: the last one).
.TP
\fBAlt+Left\fR, \fBAlt+Right\fR, \fBAlt+Home\fR
Back, forward, home page.
.TP
\fBF5\fR, \fBCtrl+R\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+R\fR, \fBEsc\fR
Reload, reload without the cache, stop.
.TP
\fBCtrl+F\fR, \fBF3\fR, \fBShift+F3\fR
Find in the page, next and previous match.
.TP
\fBCtrl++\fR, \fBCtrl+\-\fR, \fBCtrl+0\fR
Zoom in, out, actual size.
.TP
\fBCtrl+D\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+O\fR, \fBCtrl+H\fR, \fBCtrl+J\fR
Bookmark the page, bookmarks, history, downloads.
.TP
\fBF11\fR
Full screen.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/web.ini\fR
Settings: home page, search engine, JavaScript, reopening the last session's tabs.
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/fl-web/\fR
Bookmarks (\fIbookmarks.tsv\fR), history (\fIhistory.tsv\fR), cookies and site data.
.TP
\fI~/.cache/fl-web/\fR
The web cache.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-files\fR(1)
